    <briefdescription>
<para>YAML control-plane loader and validator for LLM Wiki process orchestration. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This manager loads the LLM Wiki process policy from YAML, validates mandatory security/governance invariants, and materializes the runtime control knobs for ingest/extract/synthesize/validate/re-anchor stages. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
